---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="ACHRAG English Date Format" description="ACHRAG English Date Format — Free WordPress plugin for automatic US-style date formatting">
  <style>
    .breadcrumb { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .breadcrumb a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .plugin-hero { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .plugin-hero-icon { font-size: 3.5rem; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .version { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .download-section { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin: 2rem 0; }
    .download-section h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .dl-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; background: var(--accent); color: white; padding: 0.75rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
    .dl-note { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .passive-badge { display: inline-block; background: #0f2a1a; border: 1px solid #1a4a2a; border-radius: 4px; color: #6aaa7a; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .features-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
    .features-table th { text-align: left; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .features-table td { padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .features-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    h2.section { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; }
    .supervised { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  </style>

  <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/plugins">← Plugins</a></p>

  <div class="plugin-hero">
    <span class="plugin-hero-icon">📅</span>
    <div>
      <h1>ACHRAG English Date Format</h1>
      <p class="version">Version 1.0.3 — Free — GPL v2</p>
      <p class="supervised">Supervised by jkt</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="passive-badge">No admin menu — passive, automatic</div>

  <p>Automatically applies US-style date formatting (e.g. <strong>Jun 6, 2026</strong>) to WordPress posts whose titles consist entirely of ASCII characters. Overrides WordPress locale settings and theme date formats for English-titled posts, while leaving Japanese-titled posts untouched.</p>

  <div class="download-section">
    <h2>DOWNLOAD</h2>
    <a href="/achrag-english-date-format.zip" class="dl-primary">⬇ Download ZIP</a>
    <p class="dl-note">
      Upload via WordPress Admin → Plugins → Add New → Upload Plugin.<br>
      No configuration needed — activates automatically.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section">Features</h2>
  <table class="features-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Automatic detection</td><td>Detects English-only titles and applies US date format silently</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Zero configuration</td><td>No admin menu or settings page — install and forget</td></tr>
      <tr><td>High-priority hook</td><td>Overrides WordPress locale and theme date formats (priority 999)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Published & Modified</td><td>Applies to both post date and last modified date</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Non-destructive</td><td>Japanese or mixed-script titles remain completely unaffected</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 class="section">License</h2>
  <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;">GPL v2 — Free to use, modify, and distribute.</p>
</Layout>
